    "stem": "A medical student is preparing a presentation on the history of sexual medicine. He reviews the career of Dr. Rosemary Basson, whose non-linear model of female sexual response revolutionized the field. Which of the following represents the clinical background that initially inspired Dr. Basson's research?",
