    "stem": "A 29-year-old male is brought to the emergency department by a friend 12 hours after being sexually assaulted by another man. The patient is visibly shaken, crying, and expresses intense feelings of guilt and shame. He tells the physician, \"I can't report this to the police. I should have been strong enough to fight him off.\" Which of the following is true regarding sexual assault against men?",
