    "stem": "A pediatrician is evaluating a 15-year-old adolescent with a history of chronic anxiety, substance use, and poor school performance. While reviewing the patient's social history, the clinician notes several potentially traumatic events in childhood, including witnessing domestic violence and having a parent who was incarcerated. These experiences are classified as Adverse Childhood Experiences (ACEs). According to clinical data, ACEs are linked to which of the following long-term outcomes in adulthood?",
