    "stem": "A 22-year-old primigravida at 20 weeks gestation is a heavy cigarette smoker and is struggling to quit. The clinician counsels her on the mechanisms by which tobacco smoke harms the fetus. Which of the following correctly pairs the components of tobacco smoke with their primary physiological mechanism of fetal injury?",
