      "C": "Nicotine stimulates fetal surfactant production prematurely; Carbon monoxide causes premature closure of the fetal ductus arteriosus",
      "D": "Nicotine causes direct destruction of the fetal thyroid gland; Carbon monoxide blocks active transport of amino acids",
