    "stem": "A 35-year-old G1P0 at 12 weeks gestation is involved in a motor vehicle collision and requires emergency abdominal and pelvic imaging. She is extremely anxious that any radiation exposure will inevitably cause severe fetal malformations or miscarriage. Which of the following statements is correct regarding the fetal risk of radiation exposure during pregnancy?",
