    "stem": "A 19-year-old female presents to her gynecologist for evaluation of irregular vaginal bleeding. A speculum exam reveals an abnormal lesion on the upper third of the anterior vaginal wall. A biopsy is performed and reveals clear cell adenocarcinoma of the vagina. The patient's mother notes that she took a synthetic estrogen during her pregnancy in the late 1960s to \"prevent miscarriage.\" Which of the following structural anomalies is this patient also at risk of having?",
