    "stem": "A 26-year-old female with a history of epilepsy and bipolar disorder presents for preconception counseling. She is currently managed on valproic acid. The clinician discusses the fetal risks associated with valproate exposure in the first trimester. Which of the following classic congenital anomalies is associated with valproic acid, and what preventative measure is recommended?",
