      "B": "Prescribe oral sertraline and discharge home under the supervision of family members",
      "C": "Immediate psychiatric hospitalization, separation of the infant from the mother, and antipsychotic pharmacotherapy",
      "D": "Administer high-dose intravenous magnesium sulfate for postpartum eclamptic encephalopathy",
