    "stem": "A 24-year-old male is involved in a motor vehicle accident and suffers an isolated spinal cord injury at S3. On examination, he has loss of sensation in the perineum and lacks voluntary motor control of his pelvic floor muscles. Which nerve is responsible for transmitting somatic sensation from the penile shaft and glans, and which spinal nerve segments provide the somatic and parasympathetic motor drive for erection and ejaculation? 151",
