    "stem": "A 32-year-old male is participating in a clinical trial for a novel medication designed to enhance penile smooth muscle relaxation. The researchers review the intracellular biochemical cascade that occurs upon parasympathetic stimulation. Which of the following represents the correct primary intracellular pathway that triggers relaxation?",
