    "stem": "A 37-year-old male is evaluated for persistent erectile rigidity that does not resolve after sexual intercourse. The physician explains that detumescence (penile flaccidity) is normally driven by sympathetic nerve activity. Which of the following correctly describes the primary signaling pathway and mediator that drives penile smooth muscle contraction and detumescence?",
