    "stem": "A 50-year-old male fails oral PDE-5 inhibitors and is counselled on alternative medical therapies for ED. He is interested in learning about intraurethral pellets (MUSE) and intracavernosal injections (ICI). The physician compares the pharmacology of Alprostadil and Papaverine. Which of the following correctly describes their respective mechanisms of action?",
