    "stem": "An embryology student is diagramming the cellular progression of spermatogenesis. He wants to map out the chromosome counts and divisions of each cell stage from stem cell to mature spermatozoan. Which of the following represents the correct sequence of cells, and which cell stage undergoes the first meiotic division (Meiosis I)?",
