    "stem": "A 24-year-old bodybuilder is evaluated for primary infertility and testicular shrinkage. He admits to abusing high doses of intramuscular anabolic steroids (exogenous testosterone derivatives) for the past 3 years. A semen analysis reveals azoospermia. Which of the following hormone profiles is most consistent with this patient's current endocrine state?",
