    "stem": "A 14-year-old boy presents with obesity, small hands and feet, developmental delay, and severe hypotonicity. On physical examination, he has delayed pubertal development, a microphallus, and undescended testes. His hormone panel reveals low testosterone with low LH and FSH. Which of the following is the most likely diagnosis?",
