      "B": "Direct inhibition of fetal pancreatic insulin secretion by circulating cyanide compounds",
      "C": "Competitive antagonism of placental glucose transporter GLUT-1 by polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbons",
      "D": "Premature placental senescence caused by cadmium-induced DNA polymerase alpha degradation",
      "E": "Destruction of fetal parathyroid glands resulting in systemic hypocalcemic bone growth arrest"
