    "stem": "A 28-year-old woman at 16 weeks gestation is treated for severe atypical pneumonia with an oral antimicrobial agent. The physician notes that several classes of antimicrobials are contraindicated or restricted in pregnancy due to specific fetal toxicities. Which of the following pairs correctly matches an antimicrobial agent with its characteristic teratogenic or adverse fetal effect?",
