    "stem": "A 35-year-old woman is admitted for a suction curettage (D&C) to remove a complete hydatidiform mole. Prior to the procedure, she complains of a severe headache and visual changes. Her blood pressure is 165/105 mmHg, and urinalysis reveals 3+ protein. She is currently at 14 weeks gestation. The development of this specific cardiovascular complication before 20 weeks of gestation is virtually pathognomonic for which underlying condition?",
