    "yield_level": "High",
    "stem": "A pathologist is examining tissue from a suspected partial hydatidiform mole. To confirm the diagnosis and rule out a complete mole, the pathologist performs a p57 immunostain. The tissue stains strongly positive in the cytotrophoblast and villous stromal cells. This positive stain definitively proves the presence of which of the following?",
