    "stem": "A 31-year-old woman is followed closely by her OB/GYN after undergoing a D&C for a molar pregnancy. The physician explains that one type of mole carries a much higher risk of undergoing malignant transformation into Gestational Choriocarcinoma. Which of the following compares the risk of choriocarcinoma between a complete mole and a partial mole?",
