    "stem": "A 29-year-old woman with a newly diagnosed gestational choriocarcinoma is scheduled for a full staging workup to determine the extent of metastasis before initiating chemotherapy. Because this specific tumor has a high propensity for early hematogenous spread, which of the following imaging modalities MUST be included in the initial staging to rule out the most common site of extra-pelvic metastasis?",
