      "B": "Approximately 45% of all pregnancies in the United States are unintended, and globally, approximately 61% of these unintended pregnancies end in induced abortion, according to WHO data.",
      "C": "Unintended pregnancies are universally defined as unwanted by the parents, and approximately 10% of women of reproductive age (15\u201344 years) undergo an induced abortion annually in the U.S.",
      "D": "Approximately 75% of unintended pregnancies in the United States occur in women aged 35\u201344 years, and more than 90% of these end in spontaneous miscarriage.",
      "E": "The rate of unintended pregnancy has risen exponentially among higher-income, white, college-educated, married women over the past decade due to a shift away from long-acting reversible contraception."
