    "stem": "A 23-year-old G0 female presents to discuss birth control options. She is forgetful and wants a \"set-and-forget\" method with the absolute lowest risk of pregnancy. She does not mind having irregular or light bleeding but wants to avoid a daily pill or weekly patch. What is the brand name of the subdermal contraceptive implant, what is its hormone composition, its duration of use, and its clinical efficacy relative to other contraceptive methods?",
