    "stem": "A 36-year-old female presents to the clinic to refill her prescription for combined oral contraceptive pills. During the social history, she notes that she smokes approximately one pack of cigarettes per day (20 cigarettes) and has been doing so for the past 15 years. Her blood pressure is 120/78 mmHg. According to the CDC Medical Eligibility Criteria (MEC) for Contraceptive Use, what category of eligibility applies to this patient's use of combined hormonal contraceptives (CHCs)?",
