    "stem": "A 29-year-old female who is considering an induced abortion is highly concerned about potential complications. She has read several articles online claiming that abortion causes subsequent infertility, increases the risk of breast cancer, and often leads to severe, long-term clinical depression. According to the provided sources on the complications and long-term outcomes of abortion, which of the following represents the most accurate clinical counseling?",
