    "stem": "A 22-year-old woman is prescribed topical Podophyllin resin for the treatment of vulvar condylomata acuminata. The physician applies the resin in the clinic and instructs the patient to wash it off in 4 hours to prevent severe skin necrosis. By what specific intracellular mechanism does Podophyllin physically destroy the wart tissue?",
