    "stem": "A 30-year-old man and his pregnant wife recently returned to the United States from a vacation in a country with active Zika virus transmission. Both were bitten by mosquitoes, but neither developed any symptoms of Zika virus disease (fever, rash, joint pain, conjunctivitis). The wife is terrified that the baby might develop microcephaly. Which of the following is the most accurate statement regarding asymptomatic Zika virus infection and pregnancy?",
