    "stem": "A 26-year-old G1P0 female is scheduled for uterine evacuation of a complete hydatidiform mole. The clinical team reviews the protocol to ensure a safe procedure and minimize maternal complications. What is the standard, first-line method of uterine evacuation for a hydatidiform mole, and what method is contraindicated as a primary option?",
