      "E": "Suction curettage under ultrasound guidance; medical induction of labor with oxytocin or prostaglandins is highly contraindicated as a primary evacuation method due to the risk of inducing strong uterine contractions that can force hydropic villi into pelvic veins, leading to trophoblastic pulmonary embolization."
