    "stem": "A neonatologist is evaluating a premature infant found to have vertebral defects, anal atresia, tracheoesophageal fistula, and renal anomalies, establishing a diagnosis of VACTERL association. According to the First Aid embryological tables, from which germ layer do VACTERL defects arise, and what postnatal structure represents the only remnant of the embryonic notochord?",
