      "C": "Endoderm; the postnatal remnant of the embryonic notochord is Meckel's diverticulum.",
      "D": "Neural crest; the postnatal remnant of the embryonic notochord is the Schwann cell myelin sheath.",
      "E": "Ectoderm; the postnatal remnant of the embryonic notochord is the craniopharyngioma."
