    "stem": "A clinical endocrinologist is discussing the development of the thyroid and parathyroid glands. He notes that while thyroid follicular cells and parathyroid chief cells secrete systemic hormones, they arise from the same embryonic layer that lines the gastrointestinal tract. Which of the following lists represents tissues that are entirely endodermal derivatives?",
