    "stem": "A developmental biologist is mapping the regionalization of the paraxial mesoderm. He focuses on the somites, which form transient segmental structures along the neural tube. According to the \"Chart Showing Derivatives\" slide, what are the three major subdivisions of a somite, and what postnatal tissues do they form?",
