      "B": "Notochord (which forms the spinal cord), Somite (which forms the gonads), and Splanchnopleuric mesoderm (which forms the heart).",
      "C": "Epiblast (which forms the amnion), Hypoblast (which forms the yolk sac), and Syncytiotrophoblast (which forms the chorionic plate).",
