    "stem": "A pediatric oncologist is presenting a lecture on rare vaginal tumors in children and young adults, comparing Clear Cell Adenocarcinoma of the vagina with Embryonal Rhabdomyosarcoma (sarcoma botryoides). Which of the following correctly pairs these rare vaginal malignancies with their classic risk factors, target age groups, and histopathologic findings?",
