      "B": "Apocrine metaplasia; it is a benign feature of fibrocystic change and carries no increased risk of breast carcinoma.",
      "C": "Ductal epithelial hyperplasia with atypia; carries a 1.5-to-2-fold increased risk of breast cancer.",
      "D": "Sclerosing adenosis; carries a 10-fold increased risk of bilateral breast cancer.",
