      "B": "Untreated BV leads to a 100% rate of congenital rubella-like syndrome; treated first-line with high-dose penicillin G.",
      "C": "Untreated BV leads to bilateral fallopian tube occlusion (hydrosalpinx) driven solely by Lactobacillus; treated first-line with oral doxycycline.",
      "D": "Untreated BV results in systemic septic arthritis and necrotizing skin lesions; treated first-line with ceftriaxone IM.",
