    "stem": "A 26-year-old female presents with severe vulvar itching, burning, and irritation, accompanied by a thick, white vaginal discharge that resembles \"cottage cheese.\" Bimanual pelvic exam reveals an erythematous vulva and labia with satellite lesions, but no cervical motion tenderness. How is this condition diagnosed on wet mount, and what is the typical vaginal pH?",
