    "stem": "A 32-year-old female with poorly controlled Type 2 Diabetes presents with her third episode of severe vulvovaginal candidiasis in the past 6 months. She asks why she is so susceptible to recurrent yeast infections. Which of the following lists the risk factors for recurrent candidiasis, its most common species, and the standard treatment for uncomplicated versus recurrent/resistant cases?",
