    "stem": "A pathology resident is reviewing the clinical presentation of cervicitis for a medical student rotation. She highlights the typical signs and symptoms that can be observed on physical examination and history. Which of the following is correct regarding the symptoms, physical findings, and presentation of cervicitis?",
