    "stem": "A 23-year-old female presents with dysuria, vaginal discharge, and postcoital bleeding. On speculum exam, a purulent endocervical discharge is visualized. Gram stain of the discharge reveals polymorphonuclear leukocytes (PMNs) with intracellular Gram-negative diplococci. What is the etiologic agent, how does the clinical presentation differ in men, and how is it diagnosed?",
