    "stem": "A medical student is reviewing a slide showing the microbiology and pathophysiology of Pelvic Inflammatory Disease (PID). The slide highlights how the vaginal microenvironment facilitates the ascent of pathogens into the upper reproductive tract. 209 According to the lecture materials, what role does Bacterial Vaginosis (BV) play in the development of PID?",
