      "D": "Fitz-Hugh-Curtis syndrome (perihepatitis); the three major sequelae of PID are tubal-factor infertility (blocked tubes), chronic pelvic pain from adhesions, and ectopic pregnancy.",
      "E": "McCune-Albright syndrome; major sequelae are polyostotic fibrous dysplasia, cafe-au-lait spots, and precocious puberty."
