    "stem": "A 17-year-old girl presents with left adnexal pain. A 4-cm solid ovarian mass is excised. Pathology confirms an immature teratoma. The pathologist must grade the tumor to determine the patient's prognosis and need for adjuvant chemotherapy. The grading of an immature teratoma is based strictly on the quantity of which of the following specific immature tissues present in the tumor?",
