    "stem": "A 25-year-old woman is diagnosed with a Trichomonas vaginalis infection. Her physician prescribes oral metronidazole and strongly advises her to ensure her partner also receives treatment. The physician also recommends comprehensive testing for other sexually transmitted infections (STIs). Which of the following statements best describes the rationale for this recommendation?",
