    "stem": "A 22-year-old woman presents with lower abdominal pain and is found to have cervical motion tenderness on exam. Her white blood cell count is normal, but ESR and CRP are elevated. She has a low threshold for treatment given the significant sequelae if untreated. What is the diagnosis, and what pathophysiologic process defines it?",
