    "stem": "A 65-year-old woman with ER+ breast cancer is started on Anastrozole (an Aromatase Inhibitor). Before initiating therapy, her oncologist orders a baseline dual-energy x-ray absorptiometry (DEXA) scan. Throughout her 5 years of therapy, the oncologist strongly recommends she take daily calcium and Vitamin D supplements and engage in weight-bearing exercises. This proactive management is necessary to prevent which of the following expected, severe side effects of Anastrozole?",
