        "id": "LO_Pharmacology_Masterclass_Part_1__Endocri_5",
        "text": "5. Identify the appropriate pharmacologic treatments for hyperprolactinemia (e.g., dopamine agonists like cabergoline and bromocriptine) and describe their mechanisms and side effect profiles."
