        "id": "LO_Lecture_5_1__Lower_Genital_Tract_Disease_13",
        "text": "Describe the development, gross and histologic appearance and significan ce of the TMZ ( transformation zone) of the cervix in women in regard to cervical cancer and dysplasia."
