    "stem": "A 35-year-old woman undergoes a cervical biopsy that reveals a high-grade squamous intraepithelial lesion (HSIL). Her physician orders an immunohistochemical stain for p16, which comes back strongly and diffusely positive (dark brown staining throughout the entire thickness of the epithelium). What is the molecular mechanism responsible for this massive overexpression of p16 in HPV-infected cells?",
