    "stem": "A 27-year-old woman who has smoked 1 pack of cigarettes a day for 10 years is diagnosed with CIN II. Her physician advises her that smoking significantly increases the risk that her CIN II will progress to CIN III and eventually to cancer. How does smoking most likely facilitate the progression of Cervical Intraepithelial Neoplasia?",
