    "stem": "A 38-year-old woman undergoes a conization (cone biopsy) for the treatment of CIN III. The pathologist evaluates the margins of the cone specimen. The inner (endocervical) margin is positive for dysplastic cells, indicating that the CIN III extends deep into the endocervical canal. If this lesion is left untreated, it is most likely to progress into which of the following specific histologic types of invasive cancer?",
