    "yield_level": "Low",
    "stem": "A medical student is trying to memorize the logical sequence of events during embryological sexual development to help him systematically diagnose patients with Differences of Sexual Development (DSD). He knows that if a disruption occurs at any step, all subsequent downstream events will be affected. From earliest to latest, what is the correct physiological sequence of events in typical sexual development?",
