      "D": "The 21-hydroxylase deficiency prevented the ovaries from responding to circulating pituitary gonadotropins, halting Wolffian duct growth.",
      "E": "The mutated 21-hydroxylase enzyme acted as a competitive agonist at the AMH receptor, blocking the regression of the uterus."
