    "stem": "A 25-year-old obese female with Polycystic Ovary Syndrome (PCOS) is asking her physician about beginning metformin. She has read online that metformin is a \"miracle drug\" for PCOS that can regulate her menses, reduce her facial hair, and help her lose weight. According to modern clinical guidelines and the mechanisms of action discussed in your materials, which of the following represents the correct status and role of Metformin in PCOS therapy?",
