      "B": "Somatic activating mutation in the Gnas gene, encoding the alpha-subunit of the Gs protein",
      "C": "Autosomal recessive mutation in the CYP21A2 gene, causing 21-hydroxylase deficiency",
      "D": "Deletion of the SRY gene on the Y chromosome",
      "E": "Homozygous inactivating mutation in the FSH receptor gene"
