    "yield_level": "Low",
    "stem": "A 14-year-old girl with primary ovarian insufficiency (45,X Turner syndrome) is evaluated to begin hormone replacement therapy to induce pubertal development. The clinician explains that the primary goals of therapy are to induce age-appropriate secondary sexual characteristics and stimulate a typical growth spurt without causing premature fusion of her growth plates. What is the recommended initial hormone therapy regimen for this patient?",
