    "stem": "An 8-year-old girl is evaluated for rapidly progressive breast development and a recent increase in growth velocity. Her bone age is determined to be 10.5 years (advanced). Basal LH is elevated in the pubertal range, and estradiol is high. A brain MRI reveals a 1 cm non-progressive, benign hypothalamic hamartoma. What is the most appropriate first-line medical therapy for this patient, and what is its cellular mechanism of action?",
