    "stem": "A 20-year-old female presents to her oncologist's office for counseling after testing positive for a high-risk subtype of Human Papillomavirus (HPV) during a screening exam. She is highly anxious and asks her physician about her likelihood of clearing the infection. According to the epidemiological data and clinical trials discussed in your lecture materials, which of the following is accurate regarding HPV clearance and persistence?",
