    "stem": "A research scientist is studying the molecular pathways of Human Papillomavirus (HPV) oncogenesis in a cervical carcinoma cell line. She focuses on how high-risk HPV subtypes (such as 16 and 18) integrate their genome into host DNA, leading to the overexpression of the viral oncogenes E6 and E7. How do the E6 and E7 gene products cooperatively dysregulate the host cell cycle to drive neoplastic transformation?",
