    "stem": "A pathology resident is preparing a presentation comparing Squamous Cell Carcinoma of the cervix to Adenocarcinoma of the cervix to highlight their key differences in epidemiology, histology, and clinical behavior. Which of the following statements represents a correct clinicopathological characteristic of cervical Adenocarcinoma compared to Squamous Cell Carcinoma?",
