    "stem": "A 52-year-old female with recurrent, invasive squamous cell carcinoma of the cervix that has failed primary chemoradiation therapy is being evaluated for salvage surgery. The gynecologic oncologist discusses the possibility of performing a total pelvic exenteration. According to your lecture materials, what does a pelvic exenteration procedure anatomically entail?",
