    "stem": "In an experimental model of reproductive endocrinology, researchers isolate specific cells from a developing secondary ovarian follicle. These isolated cells are cultured in vitro and exposed to various hormonal stimuli. When exposed to luteinizing hormone (LH), the cells rapidly synthesize androstenedione from cholesterol, but they are entirely unable to convert this androstenedione to estradiol. Which of the following is the most likely identity of these isolated cells?",
