    "stem": "A pathologist is examining a radical hysterectomy specimen. In the histological sections of the cervix, just deep to the mucosal epithelium, several large, thick-walled muscular arteries and dilated veins are observed within the dense collagenous stroma. The main arterial supply to the cervix is provided by the cervical branch of the uterine artery. At what anatomical location does the uterine artery characteristically cross the ureter to supply the cervix?",
