    "stem": "A 60-year-old postmenopausal woman presents with severe vaginal dryness, burning, and dyspareunia. Pelvic examination reveals a pale, thin, dry, and easily friable vaginal mucosa with absent rugae. Vaginal pH is measured at 6.5. A biopsy of the vaginal wall would most likely demonstrate which of the following histological changes compared to a woman in her reproductive years?",
