    "stem": "A 58-year-old postmenopausal woman presents to the clinic with an episode of painless, heavy vaginal bleeding. She has a BMI of 38 kg/m$^2$ and a history of hypertension. An endometrial biopsy is performed. The pathology report shows a massive overgrowth of endometrial glands with severe cytologic atypia (Complex Atypical Hyperplasia). What is the primary molecular driver of this precancerous lesion?",
