    "stem": "A 45-year-old woman is diagnosed with estrogen receptor-positive breast cancer. Following surgical resection, her oncologist prescribes Tamoxifen to reduce the risk of recurrence. After taking the medication for 3 years, she develops abnormal vaginal bleeding. Pelvic ultrasound reveals a massively thickened endometrial stripe (15 mm). An endometrial biopsy confirms endometrial carcinoma. Which of the following best explains why this specific medication caused endometrial cancer?",
