    "stem": "A 30-year-old nulliparous woman is diagnosed with atypical endometrial hyperplasia following a biopsy for irregular, heavy bleeding. She strongly desires to preserve her fertility and wishes to avoid a hysterectomy. Her physician agrees to attempt medical management. Which of the following pharmacologic agents is the most appropriate treatment to reverse her endometrial hyperplasia?",
