    "stem": "A 55-year-old postmenopausal woman with no significant past medical history and a BMI of 22 kg/m$^2$ presents with vaginal bleeding. An endometrial biopsy reveals endometrial adenocarcinoma. She undergoes a total hysterectomy and bilateral salpingo-oophorectomy. Pathology of her ovaries reveals a solid, unilateral, yellow-colored mass. Histology of the mass shows small, cuboidal cells arranged in rosette-like structures around central pink eosinophilic material (Call-Exner bodies). Which of the following hormones was this tumor most likely secreting, leading to her endometrial cancer?",
