    "stem": "A 23-year-old male undergoes a radical inguinal orchiectomy for a testicular mass. The pathology report identifies a \"mixed germ cell tumor\". According to standard pathologic guidelines, why is a mixed germ cell tumor diagnosis reported with a list of individual components and their approximate percentages?",
