    "stem": "A 34-year-old male is undergoing chemotherapy for metastatic non-seminomatous germ cell cancer. The oncologist schedules regular chest X-rays and carbon monoxide diffusing capacity (DLCO) spirometry tests to monitor for drug-induced lung toxicity. Which of the following chemotherapy agents is the primary target of this monitoring?",
