    "stem": "A basic science researcher is studying the molecular mechanisms of Benign Prostatic Hyperplasia (BPH). She focuses on how stromal cells modulate epithelial cell growth within the prostate and the role of testicular androgens. Which of the following correctly pairs the prostatic zone where early BPH begins, the cellular compartment where hyperplasia occurs first, and the primary growth factors that act as stimulators versus inhibitors of proliferation?",
