      "B": "Early BPH starts in the central zone glandular cells; hyperplasia of glands occurs first; stimulators include TGF-beta and VEGF, while KGF acts as the inhibitor",
      "C": "Early BPH starts in the peripheral zone stromal cells; hyperplasia of both compartments occurs simultaneously; stimulators include IGF and TGF-beta, while EGF acts as the inhibitor",
