    "yield_level": "Low",
    "stem": "A 72-year-old male presents with worsening lower urinary tract symptoms (LUTS). His pelvic ultrasound shows a prostate volume of 55 grams. According to epidemiologic studies cited in the lecture, what is the age-related incidence of pathologic BPH, and what percentage of men with histologic BPH actually develop clinically bothersome/symptomatic disease?",
