      "B": "Histologic BPH is present in 50% of men by age 50, with 50% of them being highly symptomatic",
      "C": "Histologic BPH is present in 95% of men by age 60, with only 1% of them being symptomatic",
      "D": "Histologic BPH begins as early as 45 years and affects 80% of men by age 80; however, only 5-10% of these patients become symptomatic",
