      "B": "Obstructive: incomplete emptying, nocturia, and urgency incontinence; Irritative: hesitancy, slow stream, and straining",
      "C": "Obstructive: terminal dribbling, overflow incontinence, and frequency; Irritative: urgency, nocturia, and hesitancy",
      "D": "Obstructive: hesitancy, frequency, and nocturia; Irritative: terminal dribbling, incomplete emptying, and straining",
