      "D": "Development of acute prostatitis and seminal vesicle cysts; metaplasia of the urothelium into transitional cell carcinoma",
      "E": "Bilateral hydronephrosis and renal cell carcinoma; selective hypertrophy of the bladder mucosa with normal detrusor muscle"
