    "stem": "A 17-year-old phenotypic female presents with primary amenorrhea. She is tall, with normal breast development but absent axillary and pubic hair. Pelvic ultrasound reveals absent uterus and fallopian tubes. Karyotype analysis demonstrates 46,XY. Bilateral gonads are found cryptorchid in the inguinal canals. The absent uterus and fallopian tubes in this specific patient are the direct result of the action of which of the following substances?",
