    "yield_level": "High",
    "stem": "In a normal male embryo (46,XY), the mesonephric (Wolffian) ducts develop into the epididymis, ductus deferens, seminal vesicles, and ejaculatory ducts (SEED). The survival, differentiation, and growth of these specific internal ductal structures are strictly dependent on the high local concentration of which of the following hormones?",
