    "stem": "During the 9th week of development, the urogenital folds in a male fetus begin to fuse in the midline, creating the ventral aspect of the penile shaft and enclosing the spongy (penile) urethra. If this fusion process fails or is incomplete due to inadequate local androgen signaling, which of the following congenital anomalies will most likely result?",
