    "stem": "A neonate is evaluated in the NICU for salt-wasting crises, hypotension, and ambiguous genitalia characterized by clitoromegaly and labial fusion. Karyotype is 46,XX. The infant is diagnosed with 21-hydroxylase deficiency. Which of the following best describes the internal reproductive organs of this infant?",
