    "stem": "A 15-year-old phenotypic female presents with primary amenorrhea. She is noted to have a short stature, a webbed neck, a broad chest with widely spaced nipples, and a low posterior hairline. Echocardiography reveals a bicuspid aortic valve. Hormonal evaluation of this patient will most likely reveal which of the following profiles?",
