    "stem": "A 35-year-old woman with a regular 28-day menstrual cycle undergoes blood testing. Her serum progesterone level is found to be greater than 10 ng/mL (a high level, confirming ovulation has occurred). Which of the following best describes the state of the hypothalamic-pituitary-ovarian (HPO) axis at this exact moment in her cycle?",
