    "stem": "A 15-year-old phenotypic female presents for evaluation of primary amenorrhea. She is found to have absent pubic and axillary hair, but normal breast development. Pelvic ultrasound reveals an absent uterus and blind-ending vagina. Her karyotype is confirmed as 46,XY. Which of the following best explains why this patient developed normal breasts despite having a 46,XY karyotype?",
