    "stem": "A 30-year-old woman with bipolar disorder presents to her gynecologist complaining of secondary amenorrhea for the past 4 months. She also reports a clear, milky discharge from her breasts. Her medical history is significant for a recent change in her psychiatric medication regimen to manage a manic episode. A pregnancy test is negative. Which of the following psychiatric medications is the most likely cause of her current symptoms?",
