    "stem": "A 30-year-old woman is evaluated for secondary amenorrhea. Her history reveals that she had a severe postpartum hemorrhage 2 years ago, requiring blood transfusions. She successfully breastfed her child for 6 months. Currently, her BMI is 25 kg/m$^2$, and she denies hot flashes. A progesterone challenge test produces brisk vaginal bleeding. What does this clinical picture suggest?",
