    "stem": "Genetic sequencing of a family with multiple males exhibiting delayed puberty, anosmia, and unilateral renal agenesis identifies a mutation in the *KAL1* gene. The protein encoded by this gene, anosmin-1, is an extracellular matrix protein essential for the proper development of the olfactory system. In early embryogenesis, the structure that normally gives rise to both the olfactory neurons and the GnRH-secreting neurons is derived from which of the following germ layers?",
