    "stem": "A 46-year-old woman undergoes a hysterectomy for severe, medically refractory dysmenorrhea and menorrhagia. The preoperative diagnosis was adenomyosis. The pathologist sections the uterus and observes thickened myometrial walls containing small, dark, blood-filled cystic spaces. Microscopic examination of these cystic spaces is most likely to reveal which of the following?",
