    "stem": "A 40-year-old woman is being evaluated for severe dysmenorrhea. Her physician is attempting to distinguish clinically between Endometriosis and Adenomyosis. Which of the following physical examination findings is the most specific discriminator pointing toward a diagnosis of Adenomyosis rather than Endometriosis?",
