    "stem": "A 45-year-old woman has an endometrial polyp removed via hysteroscopy. The pathologist evaluates the tissue under the microscope to determine if the polyp is benign or if it harbors malignancy. In premenopausal women, what is the approximate risk that an asymptomatic endometrial polyp contains malignant cells?",
