    "stem": "A 72-year-old woman undergoes a hysterectomy for an aggressive Type II (Serous) Endometrial Carcinoma. Her oncologist explains that unlike the more common, estrogen-driven form of uterine cancer, her tumor is driven by a distinct molecular pathway. Genetic analysis of her tumor cells is most likely to reveal an acquired mutation in which of the following genes?",
