    "stem": "A 59-year-old woman undergoes surgery for a uterine mass. Pathology confirms a low-grade leiomyosarcoma. The oncologist considers adjuvant hormonal blockade therapy, noting that some leiomyosarcomas express certain receptors, though they are much less responsive than benign fibroids. Which of the following hormone receptors are occasionally targeted in the management of advanced, receptor-positive leiomyosarcomas?",
