    "stem": "A 55-year-old woman undergoes a bilateral salpingo-oophorectomy for a large, suspicious ovarian mass. During the procedure, the surgeon ligates the suspensory ligament of the ovary (infundibulopelvic ligament) to control the ovarian vascular supply. Which of the following structures is at greatest risk of injury during the clamping and ligation of this specific ligament?",
