    "stem": "A 45-year-old male with recurrent, severe pelvic pain and urinary frequency is diagnosed with chronic pelvic pain syndrome. A pelvic MRI reveals a hyperintense fluid collection within the recess located between the lateral aspect of the prostate gland and the medial aspect of the obturator internus muscle. Which of the following best describes this anatomic space?",
