    "stem": "A 28-year-old woman is diagnosed with high-grade Vaginal Intraepithelial Neoplasia (VAIN III). She is a smoker and has a history of multiple sexual partners. Her physician recommends surgical excision of the affected area. During the preoperative counseling, the physician explains that because of the specific cause of her disease, she is also at a significantly increased lifetime risk of developing cancer in which of the following areas?",
