    "stem": "A 3-year-old girl is diagnosed with Sarcoma Botryoides (Embryonal Rhabdomyosarcoma) after presenting with a grape-like vaginal mass. The tumor is completely excised, and she undergoes adjuvant chemotherapy. The pathologist notes that the tumor cells exhibit characteristic cross-striations. These cells are malignant derivatives of which of the following normal embryonic tissues?",
