        "id": "LO_Lecture_5_1__Lower_Genital_Tract_Disease_24",
        "text": "Discuss r isk factors for clear cell carcinoma (DES) and sarcoma botryoides (rhabdomyosarcoma) of the vagina and their histologic appearances"
